w complete the request: make a Brass Lantern and deliver it. No more hints — you have this!":"现在完成请求：制作一个黄铜灯笼并交付它。没有更多的提示 - 你有这个！","Lesson complete. The cabinet is yours.":"课程完成。内阁是你的。","First Restoration":"第一次修复","Complete your first cabinet request board.":"完成你的第一个橱柜请求板。","Deep Discovery":"深层发现","Create a tier-5 item in any chain.":"在任何链中创建一个5级物品。","Web Clearer":"网页清除器","Merge onto 10 cobwebbed pieces in total.":"合并到总共10个蜘蛛网碎片上。","Steady Hands":"稳健操作","Complete daily cabinets on 3 different days.":"在 3 个不同的日子完成每日橱柜。","Mastery Archivist":"精通档案管理员","Complete all 5 journey mastery stages.":"完成全部 5 个旅程精通关卡。","Grand Curator":"总策展人","Complete all 40 journey stages.":"完成全部 40 个旅程关卡。","Enter a date as YYYY-MM-DD.":"输入 YYYY-MM-DD 格式的日期。","Seed copied: {seed}":"种子已复制：{seed}","Hints are turned off in Settings.":"设置中的提示已关闭。","Progress erased.":"进度已清除。","Copy today’s challenge seed":"复制今日挑战种子","Shared seed date":"共享种子日期","Play seed":"游玩种子","This removes journey progress, the codex and achievements, on this device and in your cloud save.":"这会删除此设备上和云保存中的旅程进度、法典和成就。","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, reduced motion, high contrast and text size are in the StarHermit Options.":"音量、静音、画质、语言、减少动态效果、高对比度和文字大小位于 StarHermit 选项中。","Open Options":"打开选项","Change keys and buttons":"更改按键和按钮"}
